{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MechVS: Battlefronts</strong> is a top-down, isometric, real-time, casual multiplayer game where you play as a Battle Mech pilot. Start with a base setup and upgrade during battle. Make the mech just how YOU like it by using earned points to upgrade: melee damage, ranged damage and speed! In the other hand, saved points will make you have more health points, bigger size and bigger range.<br><br>This simple system allows for replayability and tons of fun!\u00a0 Build your mecha as you fight, following different aproaches: Big Mech, with long range weak attack? Fast, medium sized with average range and melee? Small with either strong melee or ranged (short range) attack? Many more combinations can be done!<br><br>Up to 40 players per room, we have servers set in US and Asia.<br><br>:::::::::<br><br>Full release feature 20 mech designs with 3 color variants each, totalling 60 mech avatars. In the image below the 20 distinct designs are shown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1983750/extras/ce101cd30d39491fafcdb780963a06e9.avif?t=1760074528\" width=1364 height=766 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This one-page guide details all the elements you will find during battles (appart from other players).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1983750/extras/3c50eeabdb81700be683cd069f8234bd.avif?t=1760074528\" width=1130 height=632 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beware of Kaijus! They are everywhere. They are not hard to kill in a 1-vs-1 encounter once you have some upgrades, but at start of game they can decimate your starting HP and leave you weak in front of other players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1983750/extras/f6d5a33293fd81585cf97a80cca4ff7f.avif?t=1760074528\" width=1122 height=636 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can leave at any time! The game has no progression record to worry about. It is a casual game for every day that has free time to be filled with mech-packed action!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1983750/extras/a1174c39c572c492639742081d9a7b18.avif?t=1760074528\" width=1128 height=632 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1983750?t=1760074528","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1983750?t=1760074528","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1983750/8b2ad85c8f00e2ca21fb183313285964d39e268c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760074528","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1983750/8b2ad85c8f00e2ca21fb183313285964d39e268c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760074528","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MechVS: Battlefronts</strong> is a top-down, isometric, real-time, casual multiplayer game where you play as a Battle Mech pilot. Start with a base setup and upgrade during battle. Make the mech just how YOU like it by using earned points to upgrade: melee damage, ranged damage and speed! In the other hand, saved points will make you have more health points, bigger size and bigger range.<br><br>This simple system allows for replayability and tons of fun!\u00a0 Build your mecha as you fight, following different aproaches: Big Mech, with long range weak attack? Fast, medium sized with average range and melee? Small with either strong melee or ranged (short range) attack? Many more combinations can be done!<br><br>Up to 40 players per room, we have servers set in US and Asia.<br><br>:::::::::<br><br>Full release feature 20 mech designs with 3 color variants each, totalling 60 mech avatars. In the image below the 20 distinct designs are shown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1983750/extras/ce101cd30d39491fafcdb780963a06e9.avif?t=1760074528\" width=1364 height=766 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This one-page guide details all the elements you will find during battles (appart from other players).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1983750/extras/3c50eeabdb81700be683cd069f8234bd.avif?t=1760074528\" width=1130 height=632 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beware of Kaijus! They are everywhere. They are not hard to kill in a 1-vs-1 encounter once you have some upgrades, but at start of game they can decimate your starting HP and leave you weak in front of other players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1983750/extras/f6d5a33293fd81585cf97a80cca4ff7f.avif?t=1760074528\" width=1122 height=636 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=